# Local provider cache and Terraform state can contain sensitive data.
**/.terraform/
**/*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate.*
# Saved plans can contain the database password.
**/*.tfplan
**/plan-review.txt
# Keep deployment-specific inputs and authentication files out of Git.
**/terraform.tfvars
**/*.auto.tfvars
**/backend.hcl
**/gha-creds-*.json
**/crash.log
# Never commit downloaded wallets or SSH private keys.
**/*[Ww]allet*
**/*.ppk
**/*.pem
